<div>
<h1>Chef turned gamer turned paralegal turned engineer.</h1>
<p>I'm Christopher Hunter Ramsey, a 37-year-old software and tech engineer from Tulsa, Oklahoma. Before writing code I ran professional kitchens, competed as a pro gamer, and worked as a paralegal. Each career taught me something I still use: the pace of a line cook, the discipline of competition, and the precision of legal writing.</p>
<p>Today I build software and spend my free time on automotive and firearms fabrication engineering, the kind of work where tolerances matter and mistakes show.</p>
</div>
<img src="images/profile.svg" alt="Portrait of Christopher Hunter Ramsey" width="600" height="400">
