<h1>Interests</h1>
<p>I spend my time on things that reward patience and precision. Here is what keeps me busy outside of work.</p>
<section>
<h2>Automotive</h2>
<p>I enjoy building, tuning and repairing vehicles, from diagnostics to custom fabrication. The goal is the same each time: understand the system, then improve it.</p>
<img src="images/auto.svg" alt="Placeholder for a photo of my automotive project" width="600" height="400">
<p><a href="https://www.hotrod.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hot Rod magazine</a> is one of my go-to reads for inspiration.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Fabrication engineering</h2>
<p>I design and fabricate precision parts, including lawful firearms components, using machining, CAD and careful safety practices. I follow all applicable federal, state and local laws.</p>
<img src="images/fab.svg" alt="Placeholder for a photo of my fabrication workshop" width="600" height="400">
<p><a href="https://www.atf.gov/firearms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ATF firearms information</a> is where I check regulations.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Cooking and gaming</h2>
<p>My chef years left me with strong opinions about knives and seasoning. My pro gaming years left me with a competitive streak and quick reflexes.</p>
<img src="images/kitchen.svg" alt="Placeholder for a photo of a dish I cooked" width="600" height="400">
